				},
				{
					"id": 220230405,
					"content": "Do you need help with anything?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220230406,
					"content": "Ah, right. Allow me to me introduce myself. I'm Tang Wen, a historian from Liyue. Previously, I was doing some field research on the unique customs and folklore of Inazuma.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tang Wen"
				},
				{
					"id": 220230407,
					"content": "I'd finished collecting all the material I needed, in fact, and was preparing to head back to Liyue. But so many big things have happened in Inazuma recently...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tang Wen"
				},
				{
					"id": 220230408,
					"content": "So I feel like I'm living in historic times here, you know?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tang Wen"
				},
				{
					"id": 220230409,
					"content": "The happenings of this particular period will certainly leave a strong mark in the annals of Teyvat's history.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tang Wen"
				},
				{
					"id": 220230410,
					"content": "To witness such history with one's own eyes, and then record all of it in a true, complete, and clear manner for posterity — that is what a historian should do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tang Wen"
				},
				{
					"id": 220230411,
					"content": "But... as exciting as this cause is to me, it won't satisfy my stomach...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tang Wen"
				},
				{
					"id": 220230412,
					"content": "Hungry, are we?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230413
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220230413,
					"content": "Well, I wouldn't say that exactly... Inazuma's food is actually pretty tasty.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tang Wen"
				},
				{
					"id": 220230414,
					"content": "I really like the tempura here, although it's, well... They just wrap everything in batter and fry it, you know?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220230415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tang Wen"
				},
				{
					"id": 220230415,
					"content": "But after eating Inazuman cuisine for a long time, I started to miss dishes from back home. Sadly, I couldn't find a restaurant here that could make authentic Liyue cuisine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
